WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.947
=Episode 27=

01:52.880 --> 01:53.520
Lin Mei.

01:54.319 --> 01:54.880
Lin Mei.

01:55.626 --> 01:57.270
We've been waiting three days already.

01:57.270 --> 01:59.048
Did anyone ask around
at the cooperative?

02:02.240 --> 02:03.679
I remember that day,

02:03.679 --> 02:05.520
he said he was going to catch a train.

02:06.479 --> 02:07.679
Do you think

02:07.679 --> 02:09.320
he might've left it on the train?

02:12.719 --> 02:15.200
How about we turn
the money in to the police?

02:15.200 --> 02:16.439
We've been stuck with it.

02:16.439 --> 02:17.719
I can't even sleep in peace.

02:17.719 --> 02:19.119
I keep dreaming it's gone.

02:26.839 --> 02:27.640
Fei Ting.

02:29.119 --> 02:31.200
If no one comes looking for it,

02:32.640 --> 02:34.159
do you think it's possible

02:35.920 --> 02:37.240
we could keep the money...

02:37.240 --> 02:37.800
No.

02:38.640 --> 02:39.640
That's not possible.

02:40.137 --> 02:42.520
It's someone else's money.
I wouldn't feel right using it.

02:44.960 --> 02:45.399
Right.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.360
I was just

02:47.719 --> 02:48.879
thinking out loud.

02:53.640 --> 02:55.080
Let's wait three more days.

02:55.679 --> 02:56.879
If no one shows up after that,

02:57.320 --> 02:58.520
we'll take it to the police.

02:59.839 --> 03:00.240
Okay.

03:01.080 --> 03:01.599
Let's sleep.

03:14.040 --> 03:15.040
Comrade Fei Ting,

03:17.320 --> 03:18.439
I was wrong earlier.

03:18.870 --> 03:20.337
I shouldn't have had the thoughts.

03:20.999 --> 03:22.760
Thank you for correcting me in time.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.320
Go to sleep.

03:28.839 --> 03:29.320
Sleep.

04:05.679 --> 04:06.240
Morning.

04:06.240 --> 04:07.137
Morning, Ms. Fang.

04:07.510 --> 04:08.191
Morning.

04:18.200 --> 04:19.200
Morning, Mom.

04:22.919 --> 04:24.120
I brought you two eggs.

04:24.204 --> 04:25.710
You should have some extra protein.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.871
No need. I've already eaten.

04:28.320 --> 04:30.120
And call me Ms. Mu.

04:31.919 --> 04:32.839
Got it, Mom.

04:34.599 --> 04:36.239
I'll leave the eggs here.

04:36.239 --> 04:38.159
Have them if you get hungry.

04:44.080 --> 04:45.440
Ms. Fang, step outside with me.

04:48.159 --> 04:48.880
Mom.

04:57.520 --> 04:58.200
Fang Mujing.

04:58.440 --> 04:59.640
What are you trying to do?

05:01.239 --> 05:01.799
Mom...

05:01.799 --> 05:02.880
Don't call me Mom.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.839
You already cut ties with us.

05:08.080 --> 05:09.520
That was just for show.

05:09.919 --> 05:11.080
In my heart, I never

05:11.080 --> 05:12.080
cut ties with you.

05:14.120 --> 05:14.839
Besides,

05:15.120 --> 05:16.320
I never asked you to claim me.

05:16.640 --> 05:17.719
Can't I claim you instead?

05:17.919 --> 05:18.719
No.

05:19.115 --> 05:20.320
I'm not your mother anymore.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.279
Sorry, you don't get to decide that.

05:23.239 --> 05:24.919
Unless you can put me back in your womb,

05:25.039 --> 05:26.440
you'll always be my mom.

05:27.239 --> 05:28.560
I told you,

05:28.560 --> 05:29.320
don't call me that

05:29.320 --> 05:30.239
ever again!

05:31.320 --> 05:33.039
Only my mom can lecture me.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.520
I'm off, Mom.

05:46.919 --> 05:47.560
Mujing,

05:49.080 --> 05:50.719
Ms. Mu is really your mom?

05:52.335 --> 05:52.974
Yeah.

05:53.399 --> 05:55.520
The Mu in my name comes from her.

05:55.799 --> 05:56.599
Oh my God.

05:57.320 --> 05:59.200
No wonder you two look so alike.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.080
With brains like yours,

06:01.080 --> 06:01.880
you must...

06:14.279 --> 06:14.799
Mom,

06:14.960 --> 06:16.120
can I borrow an eraser?

06:20.399 --> 06:21.520
Thanks, Mom.

06:34.950 --> 06:37.160
(Long live the unity of the world)

06:46.359 --> 06:46.919
Welcome.

06:49.880 --> 06:50.640
Mr. Yuan,

06:50.640 --> 06:52.440
looks like you're enjoying
being a waiter.

06:54.520 --> 06:55.680
Lost a bet last time.

06:56.080 --> 06:57.640
You actually left the newspaper.

06:58.640 --> 06:59.719
A bet's a bet.

07:01.839 --> 07:02.640
Actually,

07:03.599 --> 07:04.880
you didn't really lose that day.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.960
I took Fei Ni's words to heart.

07:08.479 --> 07:09.479
Every single one.

07:10.080 --> 07:11.680
Most of the time,

07:12.200 --> 07:14.839
reality is powerful enough on its own.

07:14.839 --> 07:16.880
All we have to do is capture it.

07:18.200 --> 07:19.680
So when I was drawing that day,

07:20.120 --> 07:22.279
I borrowed
some of your strengths and style.

07:22.799 --> 07:23.919
You didn't lose to me.

07:24.839 --> 07:26.320
You lost to me and to yourself.

07:29.200 --> 07:31.159
Then you really should thank my wife.

07:34.080 --> 07:34.680
By the way,

07:34.680 --> 07:36.080
I'm here for something important.

07:37.320 --> 07:39.120
The publishing house is putting out

07:39.440 --> 07:41.080
a batch of novels about educated youth.

07:41.640 --> 07:42.719
They need illustrations.

07:43.320 --> 07:44.239
Interested

07:44.680 --> 07:45.799
in working with me?

07:47.279 --> 07:48.320
And don't worry.

07:48.320 --> 07:50.399
I won't touch a single stroke this time.

07:52.599 --> 07:53.399
Mr. Yuan,

07:54.399 --> 07:56.039
who's the author?

07:56.359 --> 07:57.479
Not decided yet.

07:58.279 --> 07:58.960
If you and I

07:58.960 --> 08:00.399
finish this smoothly,

08:00.799 --> 08:02.200
I'll try to get you a position

08:02.200 --> 08:03.271
at the publishing house.

08:04.320 --> 08:05.120
What do you think?

08:14.080 --> 08:15.080
No need, Mr. Yuan.

08:16.000 --> 08:18.440
I'm quite happy with my current job.

08:19.000 --> 08:19.880
It's free.

08:20.839 --> 08:22.120
I draw whatever I want.

08:22.719 --> 08:23.719
These are all mine.

08:36.610 --> 08:37.547
(Cold dishes, cold ham)

08:39.997 --> 08:42.697
(Cream bread,
dinner rolls, sliced baguette.)

08:48.671 --> 08:51.130
(Math Department Teaching Office)
Okay. That's it for today.

08:59.235 --> 09:05.147
(Educators must first be educated.)

09:09.080 --> 09:09.599
Mom,

09:09.759 --> 09:11.320
you should head back and rest.

09:12.879 --> 09:13.719
Fang Mujing,

09:13.920 --> 09:15.320
you weren't like this before.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.519
You weren't either.

09:18.119 --> 09:19.119
I'm telling you,

09:19.119 --> 09:20.599
if you dare call me Mom again...

09:20.599 --> 09:21.440
Mom...

09:24.800 --> 09:25.639
Still working?

09:27.320 --> 09:29.839
Mujing and I will walk you home later.

09:30.047 --> 09:30.681
Yes.

09:35.080 --> 09:35.560
No need.

09:41.239 --> 09:41.800
Qu Hua,

09:42.719 --> 09:43.839
are you free Tuesday?

09:44.879 --> 09:45.479
I should be.

09:45.719 --> 09:46.359
Why?

09:47.920 --> 09:49.320
Have dinner at my place with me.

09:50.200 --> 09:50.680
Sure.

09:51.119 --> 09:51.680
Oh, right.

09:51.879 --> 09:53.080
Tell Fang Muyang.

09:53.239 --> 09:54.400
Give him a heads-up.

09:55.479 --> 09:56.599
Keeping up the momentum?

09:56.800 --> 09:57.320
No.

09:57.879 --> 09:59.879
This is persistence.

10:06.879 --> 10:07.839
Mr. Yuan said

10:08.479 --> 10:10.320
the novel about educated youth

10:10.320 --> 10:11.759
still doesn't have an author.

10:13.839 --> 10:15.119
Want to give it a try?

10:15.479 --> 10:16.280
Me?

10:18.639 --> 10:20.920
I've only ever published one article.

10:22.759 --> 10:24.519
Who said just one?

10:25.835 --> 10:26.355
There's also

10:26.355 --> 10:28.514
that brilliant comic review.

10:29.320 --> 10:30.719
Comrade Tian Xueying.

10:31.759 --> 10:33.280
(I'm reading readers' letters.)

10:33.440 --> 10:34.359
That many?

10:34.359 --> 10:35.160
Especially this one.

10:35.160 --> 10:35.960
Let me read it.

10:36.160 --> 10:38.119
A letter from Comrade Tian Xueying.

10:39.080 --> 10:39.400
You...

10:39.639 --> 10:41.040
When did you find out?

10:41.479 --> 10:42.960
The moment I got it.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.719
I recognize your handwriting.

10:47.519 --> 10:49.080
Then why ask me to reply?

10:50.759 --> 10:51.760
I'm not much with words.

10:51.822 --> 10:53.238
At most I'd write back...

10:53.359 --> 10:54.185
"Too kind."

10:54.879 --> 10:55.519
"Thank you."

10:58.239 --> 10:58.920
But seriously,

10:59.400 --> 11:00.604
why not submit something?

11:01.519 --> 11:02.879
I don't want Mr. Yuan's help.

11:03.920 --> 11:04.999
You don't have to.

11:05.710 --> 11:06.471
Did you forget?

11:06.590 --> 11:08.204
We have a cultured man
in the house.

11:09.759 --> 11:10.160
Dad,

11:11.182 --> 11:13.115
do you know anyone
at a publishing house?

11:13.320 --> 11:14.440
The publishing house?

11:14.839 --> 11:15.960
Of course I do.

11:16.680 --> 11:17.479
Remember Mr. Li?

11:17.560 --> 11:18.519
When you were little,

11:18.800 --> 11:20.639
he always came by.

11:20.839 --> 11:22.239
He works at a publishing house.

11:23.599 --> 11:24.160
Why?

11:25.160 --> 11:26.519
Could you help submit

11:26.519 --> 11:27.359
Fei Ni's novel?

11:29.320 --> 11:30.160
Sure.

11:31.560 --> 11:33.440
But I won't pull strings.

11:33.759 --> 11:34.400
No favors.

11:34.719 --> 11:35.680
It's fair competition.

11:36.719 --> 11:37.479
So,

11:37.839 --> 11:39.119
what are you planning to write?

11:39.759 --> 11:41.479
The theme this time is

11:41.479 --> 11:42.479
educated youth.

11:43.080 --> 11:45.320
Life as an educated youth?

11:45.839 --> 11:46.759
That's good.

11:47.400 --> 11:48.160
However,

11:48.320 --> 11:49.920
don't focus only on them.

11:49.920 --> 11:51.239
You could add

11:51.800 --> 11:53.040
an elderly intellectual

11:53.040 --> 11:54.280
to the story.

11:54.280 --> 11:55.320
For example,

11:55.320 --> 11:56.479
a resilient,

11:56.479 --> 11:58.759
optimistic old painter.

11:58.920 --> 11:59.400
Right?

12:00.320 --> 12:01.119
Better yet,

12:01.119 --> 12:02.759
a landscape painter.

12:03.680 --> 12:04.239
Yes,

12:04.680 --> 12:05.759
that's the idea.

12:07.040 --> 12:07.359
Dad,

12:08.440 --> 12:09.639
we don't have a theme yet.

12:10.119 --> 12:11.560
Let's save the supporting roles

12:11.639 --> 12:12.719
for later.

12:13.639 --> 12:13.960
Fine.

12:14.350 --> 12:14.893
Alright.

12:15.759 --> 12:16.160
Fei Ni,

12:16.920 --> 12:18.479
go see your brother tomorrow.

12:18.639 --> 12:19.839
He was an educated youth too.

12:20.119 --> 12:21.119
Gather more material.

12:22.048 --> 12:24.110
If you need to interview
a supporting character,

12:24.839 --> 12:25.759
I'm OK.

12:27.560 --> 12:28.119
Got it, Dad.

12:34.119 --> 12:34.719
I think

12:35.119 --> 12:36.999
the lead should be
a male educated youth.

12:37.359 --> 12:38.239
Make it moving.

12:38.639 --> 12:39.359
For example,

12:39.719 --> 12:42.160
he volunteers to go
to the countryside for his sister.

12:42.759 --> 12:44.239
If it's written by a woman,

12:44.239 --> 12:45.680
then it should be about a woman.

12:45.999 --> 12:46.519
What?

12:46.759 --> 12:48.920
Women can't brave the elements?

12:48.920 --> 12:49.320
Of course,

12:49.320 --> 12:50.759
there are female educated youth.

12:50.759 --> 12:52.680
I just think the lead
works better as a man.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.960
Let me say something.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.359
It doesn't matter

12:55.359 --> 12:56.920
whether the lead is male or female.

12:56.920 --> 12:59.119
What matters is a harmonious family.

12:59.400 --> 13:00.759
Write about their home life.

13:00.759 --> 13:01.800
For example, the parents.

13:01.800 --> 13:02.680
They're wonderful.

13:02.680 --> 13:03.599
Especially the father.

13:03.599 --> 13:04.560
He plays chess.

13:04.560 --> 13:05.639
He practices Tai Chi.

13:05.639 --> 13:06.160
Right?

13:06.160 --> 13:07.026
Alright, alright.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.960
I can hear all your scheming

13:08.960 --> 13:10.119
from next door.

13:10.800 --> 13:12.200
Ni finally has a chance

13:12.200 --> 13:13.160
to prove herself.

13:13.680 --> 13:15.119
I have no demands.

13:15.280 --> 13:16.440
Write it however you like.

13:17.479 --> 13:18.320
Just one thing.

13:18.440 --> 13:20.200
Maybe you could use my name.

13:20.519 --> 13:20.999
Baoying.

13:21.560 --> 13:22.759
It sounds like

13:23.320 --> 13:24.359
a fearless,

13:24.759 --> 13:25.920
inspiring,

13:26.119 --> 13:27.960
heroic young woman.

13:28.359 --> 13:28.719
Fine.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.160
Mom, I'll use it.

13:31.440 --> 13:33.080
Then my name's even better.

13:33.239 --> 13:34.440
"Lin Mei" works too.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.560
You can use them all.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.759
Make it the whole family.

13:36.759 --> 13:38.359
Listen to me. I know this stuff.

13:40.920 --> 13:43.920
Put our stories in there too.

13:44.040 --> 13:44.719
Right?

13:44.719 --> 13:46.400
How about writing your father

13:46.400 --> 13:47.229
as a chess player?

13:47.230 --> 13:48.537
I went to the countryside too.

13:49.119 --> 13:50.920
From a woman's perspective, it should...

13:55.639 --> 13:56.239
Chen.

13:58.119 --> 13:58.560
Ling Yi.

13:59.119 --> 13:59.680
You're here.

13:59.879 --> 14:00.920
Sorry to keep you waiting.

14:01.119 --> 14:01.440
Sit.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.119
What is it?

14:06.839 --> 14:07.440
Chen,

14:08.372 --> 14:10.331
I don't want to stay
in the Publicity Division.

14:11.247 --> 14:12.647
Transfer me to your department.

14:17.119 --> 14:18.320
A transfer?

14:19.920 --> 14:21.119
That won't be easy.

14:22.639 --> 14:23.879
But it's not impossible.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.160
It depends...

14:32.359 --> 14:33.599
It depends on your performance.

14:57.040 --> 14:58.040
You dare hit me?

14:58.040 --> 14:59.160
Because you're a pervert!

14:59.200 --> 14:59.759
Ye Feng!

15:00.397 --> 15:01.397
Chen, go!

15:01.560 --> 15:03.293
- What are you doing? Let go.
- Just go.

15:03.382 --> 15:04.110
Ling Yi, let go.

15:04.119 --> 15:04.879
Ye Feng.

15:04.879 --> 15:05.759
Leave now.

15:06.160 --> 15:07.080
Let go of me!

15:07.359 --> 15:08.560
Ye Feng, this is a school.

15:08.560 --> 15:09.960
What do you think you're doing?

15:14.119 --> 15:15.040
Stop defending him!

15:26.560 --> 15:27.119
Ye Feng,

15:29.119 --> 15:30.872
this is where we first met.

15:32.247 --> 15:33.328
This is where we began.

15:34.060 --> 15:35.197
Let's end it here, too.

15:38.280 --> 15:39.400
You really want a divorce?

15:40.080 --> 15:40.560
Ye Feng,

15:41.519 --> 15:42.080
you're lazy,

15:42.080 --> 15:42.839
but I'm not.

15:44.359 --> 15:46.359
Why can't you just be content?

15:46.879 --> 15:48.080
Is our life really that bad?

15:48.080 --> 15:49.349
If I were that easy to satisfy,

15:49.350 --> 15:51.430
I'd still be in Great Northern
Wilderness feeding pigs.

15:51.448 --> 15:52.930
I wouldn't have gone to my senior

15:52.935 --> 15:54.136
again and again for you.

15:54.260 --> 15:56.360
I wouldn't have pushed you to study!

16:02.160 --> 16:03.160
Tomorrow at 10 AM,

16:03.893 --> 16:05.040
at the subdistrict office.

16:27.835 --> 16:30.860
(Family Quarters)
(Unite and strive for greater victories)

16:37.280 --> 16:37.960
Where's Ling Yi?

16:42.280 --> 16:43.719
Didn't I tell you?

16:44.320 --> 16:45.960
Go talk to her properly.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.999
Win her back.

16:59.160 --> 17:00.719
She's with another man.

17:03.160 --> 17:04.239
Her senior.

17:05.759 --> 17:06.360
Chen Donghua.

17:12.120 --> 17:12.840
You mean

17:13.920 --> 17:16.239
Ling Yi has a moral conduct issue?

17:22.440 --> 17:23.279
Son,

17:23.680 --> 17:24.960
that's serious.

17:25.960 --> 17:26.999
You can't just

17:27.120 --> 17:27.920
throw accusations

17:28.160 --> 17:29.960
at your own wife.

17:30.239 --> 17:30.680
Mom,

17:33.160 --> 17:34.239
I saw it myself.

17:37.880 --> 17:39.160
I agreed to divorce her.

17:58.880 --> 18:00.759
That's indecent!

18:02.360 --> 18:03.759
Some bureau chief's secretary?

18:07.360 --> 18:07.799
Ye Feng,

18:08.160 --> 18:09.279
write a report.

18:10.360 --> 18:11.319
Tomorrow I'll go

18:11.840 --> 18:12.759
to their workplace

18:13.160 --> 18:14.799
and report him.

18:14.840 --> 18:15.360
Mom,

18:17.479 --> 18:18.120
forget it.

18:19.400 --> 18:20.039
Let it go?

18:20.880 --> 18:22.319
How can we let it go?

18:22.319 --> 18:23.960
If we report Chen Donghua, Ling Yi...

18:28.279 --> 18:29.200
She won't graduate.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.759
You're getting divorced,

18:36.893 --> 18:38.270
and you still care about her?

18:38.279 --> 18:39.999
I'm the one who chose the divorce.

18:42.759 --> 18:43.200
Mom,

18:44.479 --> 18:45.120
that's it.

18:47.799 --> 18:48.479
That's it.

19:32.799 --> 19:34.319
(Can you teach me how to shoot hoops?)

19:34.640 --> 19:35.039
(Ling Yi,)

19:35.759 --> 19:36.880
(you've been so good to me.)

19:37.319 --> 19:38.319
(If I didn't like you,)

19:38.559 --> 19:39.685
(I'd have to be blind.)

19:44.120 --> 19:44.920
(This abacus)

19:45.039 --> 19:46.640
(is my gift for you.)

19:46.960 --> 19:47.519
(Study hard.)

19:49.120 --> 19:50.440
(I'm not cut out for this.)

19:50.440 --> 19:51.737
(I don't even want to learn.)

19:52.085 --> 19:53.840
(Even if I'm a lump of mud,)

19:53.840 --> 19:55.519
(I'll have to climb higher!)

19:55.871 --> 19:57.400
(Ling Yi)
(You're lazy, but I'm not.)

20:02.120 --> 20:03.160
(This is where we began.)

20:03.735 --> 20:05.010
(Let's end it here, too.)

20:20.660 --> 20:22.522
(Divorce Certificate,
Ye Feng and Ling Yi)

20:26.279 --> 20:27.960
Anything left to pick up at home?

20:28.999 --> 20:29.760
Another time.

20:31.360 --> 20:31.719
Okay.

20:33.039 --> 20:33.880
I'll go first.

21:05.840 --> 21:06.559
Here, Ms. Xu.

21:07.079 --> 21:07.559
Take a look.

21:09.600 --> 21:10.479
Wonderful!

21:10.759 --> 21:12.600
It's exactly like the photo.

21:12.960 --> 21:13.960
Thank you, Fang.

21:14.200 --> 21:15.026
You're welcome.

21:16.479 --> 21:18.880
Could you paint those people

21:18.922 --> 21:20.799
(Long live the unity of the world)
behind me,

21:21.239 --> 21:22.160
so it feels like

21:22.360 --> 21:23.559
I'm standing together

21:23.600 --> 21:25.204
with the people of the world?

21:30.999 --> 21:32.160
It's doable.

21:34.920 --> 21:35.479
Ms. Xu,

21:36.759 --> 21:37.680
I have a request, too.

21:38.160 --> 21:38.680
What is it?

21:39.200 --> 21:40.759
Could I borrow the café's coffee pot

21:41.671 --> 21:42.960
and take it home for a night?

21:43.880 --> 21:44.960
Store policy says

21:44.960 --> 21:46.600
nothing leaves the premises.

21:47.750 --> 21:48.648
How about this?

21:48.920 --> 21:49.999
I'll leave

21:50.279 --> 21:51.200
a ten-yuan deposit

21:51.400 --> 21:52.239
and my work ID.

21:52.519 --> 21:52.920
Okay?

21:54.200 --> 21:54.799
Ms. Xu,

21:55.519 --> 21:56.400
just one night.

21:56.799 --> 21:58.200
I'll bring it back in the morning.

21:58.559 --> 21:59.479
I won't damage it.

22:01.079 --> 22:02.479
Alright. Just one night.

22:03.079 --> 22:03.600
Great.

22:04.120 --> 22:04.559
No problem.

22:40.279 --> 22:41.039
Here, Fei Ni.

22:42.559 --> 22:43.239
Try it.

22:44.600 --> 22:45.559
Will this even help?

22:46.279 --> 22:47.319
Take a sip and see.

22:51.799 --> 22:52.799
So bitter.

22:53.600 --> 22:54.680
Is it too strong?

22:55.079 --> 22:55.600
Too strong?

22:56.039 --> 22:56.759
Let me try.

23:02.200 --> 23:02.840
Yeah.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.360
It's a bit strong.

23:04.960 --> 23:06.519
But it'll help you focus.

23:07.519 --> 23:07.960
Alright.

23:17.200 --> 23:17.840
Don't waste it.

23:23.279 --> 23:24.239
Wide awake now.

23:25.247 --> 23:31.540
♪If the future cannot be grasped♪

23:32.100 --> 23:38.340
♪Don't think too far ahead,
just work hard for today♪

23:40.519 --> 23:42.200
The coffee works wonders!

23:42.410 --> 23:46.380
♪Light up the corners that need it♪

23:46.672 --> 23:51.700
♪The ones who smile the most,
gain the most in return♪

23:52.935 --> 24:00.100
♪I want a life that's real,
steady, feet on solid ground♪

24:00.100 --> 24:03.439
♪Our paths begin to cross♪

24:03.440 --> 24:06.660
♪Each day
holds something to look forward to♪

24:06.740 --> 24:13.740
♪Live it real.
Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

24:13.740 --> 24:19.940
♪Collecting ordinary moments in life,
making them into memories♪

24:42.999 --> 24:43.440
Ling Yi,

24:43.999 --> 24:45.120
are you free in a few days?

24:45.204 --> 24:46.582
Come on a work trip with me.

24:47.719 --> 24:48.239
Chen,

24:48.960 --> 24:51.120
when can you arrange my transfer?

24:52.519 --> 24:53.200
Relax.

24:53.479 --> 24:54.160
Don't rush.

24:54.470 --> 24:55.360
One step at a time.

24:57.200 --> 24:57.999
Chen,

24:58.640 --> 24:59.972
as for us,

25:00.030 --> 25:01.071
let's also take it slow.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.200
Come on.

25:03.360 --> 25:03.982
Don't worry.

25:04.319 --> 25:05.400
I'll speed things up.

25:09.200 --> 25:09.600
Ling Yi,

25:10.680 --> 25:11.479
give me a kiss.

25:11.840 --> 25:13.440
Chen, we're at school.

25:13.440 --> 25:14.759
It's fine. No one will see.

25:14.759 --> 25:15.559
Chen Donghua!

25:16.750 --> 25:18.048
What do you think you're doing?

25:18.079 --> 25:18.519
Honey...

25:18.719 --> 25:19.039
Wait...

25:19.360 --> 25:19.880
It's not...

25:19.960 --> 25:21.060
There's nothing between us!

25:21.079 --> 25:22.719
She threw herself at me for a transfer!

25:23.239 --> 25:24.440
You dare seduce my husband?

25:24.559 --> 25:25.759
Shameless woman!

25:35.360 --> 25:35.999
Chen,

25:37.400 --> 25:38.400
you're married?

25:41.400 --> 25:42.400
Of course, I am.

25:42.999 --> 25:43.440
Ling Yi,

25:43.559 --> 25:44.719
you're morally corrupt.

25:45.039 --> 25:46.319
Don't contact me again.

25:46.719 --> 25:47.160
Let's go.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.120
I'm telling you,

25:52.200 --> 25:53.039
just wait.

25:53.440 --> 25:55.110
I'm reporting you to the school.

25:56.382 --> 25:57.430
What are you staring at?

25:57.572 --> 25:58.291
Move!

26:13.737 --> 26:15.010
(Jiangcheng University,
Teaching Building No. 1)

26:15.039 --> 26:15.719
(Ling Yi,)

26:16.279 --> 26:17.872
(in light of your misconduct,)

26:18.279 --> 26:20.039
(you are hereby expelled.)

26:33.759 --> 26:34.680
Fei!

26:35.079 --> 26:36.960
Someone sent you
a commendation banner.

26:37.337 --> 26:38.693
(Money Lost and Found)
Fei!

26:38.880 --> 26:39.630
Comrade, over here.

26:39.650 --> 26:40.248
Alright.

26:43.440 --> 26:43.840
Fei Ting.

26:44.160 --> 26:44.559
Lin Mei.

26:44.759 --> 26:45.079
Mom.

26:45.200 --> 26:45.519
Dad.

26:46.479 --> 26:47.272
What is this?

26:47.719 --> 26:49.239
This is the owner.

26:50.041 --> 26:50.801
That day,

26:50.801 --> 26:52.239
he was rushing to catch a train.

26:52.239 --> 26:53.885
He thought he left his bag on it.

26:53.999 --> 26:55.559
That's why it took him days to find you.

26:56.848 --> 26:57.626
Comrade, here.

26:57.897 --> 26:59.039
(Money Lost and Found)

26:59.039 --> 26:59.680
Thank you.

27:00.319 --> 27:00.920
Thank you.

27:01.360 --> 27:01.960
If not for you,

27:01.960 --> 27:03.182
I'd never have gotten it back.

27:03.999 --> 27:04.680
Thank you.

27:05.880 --> 27:06.759
Well done.

27:06.960 --> 27:07.440
Fei.

27:07.559 --> 27:09.360
That's the pride of our neighborhood!

27:11.039 --> 27:11.840
So wonderful.

27:11.840 --> 27:14.079
This boy has had
my integrity since day one.

27:15.479 --> 27:16.440
That's right.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.200
Exactly.

27:17.999 --> 27:19.519
Wonderful.

27:19.519 --> 27:20.759
He's made us all proud!

27:25.985 --> 27:34.422
(To Comrades Lin Mei and Fei Ting
for their honesty. From Li Weihong)

27:34.472 --> 27:36.360
(Overview of Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory)

27:36.360 --> 27:37.960
Make sure these figures are accurate.

27:38.319 --> 27:38.759
Be careful.

27:38.759 --> 27:39.200
Report.

27:39.279 --> 27:39.719
Alright.

27:40.960 --> 27:41.759
Fei Ting's here.

27:42.519 --> 27:43.559
Here, take this.

27:43.559 --> 27:43.960
Come in.

27:43.960 --> 27:44.799
Yes, Vice Director.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.319
Vice Director Chen,

27:48.360 --> 27:49.600
what did you need me for?

27:50.079 --> 27:50.999
Good news.

27:51.999 --> 27:52.640
You returned

27:52.960 --> 27:53.960
the lost money

27:54.120 --> 27:55.293
and showed real integrity.

28:00.479 --> 28:01.160
Take a look.

28:04.335 --> 28:06.735
(Comrade Fei Ting is approved
as a full-time cook.)

28:07.479 --> 28:08.600
I hereby announce

28:09.160 --> 28:09.799
that you are

28:10.160 --> 28:11.360
being made permanent.

28:13.400 --> 28:14.160
Comrade Fei Ting,

28:14.519 --> 28:15.120
welcome back

28:15.319 --> 28:17.799
to the Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

28:19.790 --> 28:20.915
Thank you, Vice Director.

28:21.319 --> 28:23.120
Thank you, Vice Director.

28:23.448 --> 28:24.600
Thank you, Vice Director.

28:27.880 --> 28:29.960
You put your work skills to good use.

28:30.990 --> 28:31.893
Save your strength

28:32.079 --> 28:33.640
and make us more good food.

28:33.880 --> 28:34.960
I won't let you down.

28:36.079 --> 28:36.400
Alright.

28:36.600 --> 28:36.960
Go on.

28:37.440 --> 28:37.719
Yes.

29:15.200 --> 29:15.920
How is it?

29:16.293 --> 29:17.550
Haven't played in a while.

29:19.440 --> 29:19.920
Where

29:20.600 --> 29:21.600
did this come from?

29:22.759 --> 29:23.719
The authorities

29:24.079 --> 29:25.999
have started
restoring my parents' status.

29:26.840 --> 29:28.479
They returned our family's belongings.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.160
That's wonderful.

29:36.759 --> 29:37.559
Come try it.

30:02.660 --> 30:07.410
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

30:09.740 --> 30:14.300
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

30:16.620 --> 30:22.940
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

30:23.535 --> 30:31.347
♪When the world is covered in snow,
I still think of you♪

30:33.772 --> 30:39.780
♪There is a small place♪

30:40.660 --> 30:47.100
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

30:47.597 --> 30:54.885
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

30:55.047 --> 31:02.497
♪Remember, that's me thinking of you♪

31:07.079 --> 31:07.999
The fish is ready.

31:11.759 --> 31:12.200
Here.

31:14.999 --> 31:16.600
What's the occasion today?

31:16.840 --> 31:18.559
You even cooked yourself.

31:19.600 --> 31:20.200
Well,

31:20.200 --> 31:22.079
I invited a friend over for dinner.

31:23.759 --> 31:25.120
You made all this?

31:25.200 --> 31:25.719
Of course.

31:25.999 --> 31:27.120
You've improved.

31:39.840 --> 31:40.519
What's wrong?

31:45.226 --> 31:46.510
No matter how hard the test,

31:46.999 --> 31:48.239
you'll have to face it.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.600
If you fail,

31:51.559 --> 31:52.680
I'll retake it with you.

31:54.360 --> 31:55.360
All my life,

31:56.559 --> 31:57.960
I've never failed once.

32:13.279 --> 32:13.999
Are they here?

32:14.279 --> 32:14.880
They are.

32:14.880 --> 32:15.479
I'll get it.

32:19.279 --> 32:20.079
Come on in.

32:20.079 --> 32:21.200
Please, come in.

32:21.200 --> 32:21.519
Come.

32:28.079 --> 32:28.759
Dad, Mom,

32:29.279 --> 32:30.440
let me introduce you.

32:30.759 --> 32:31.999
This is Comrade Qu Hua.

32:32.239 --> 32:33.079
He's a doctor.

32:33.079 --> 32:34.479
We met in the disaster zone.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.279
And this is his wife.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.400
Dad.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.459
Mom.

32:42.799 --> 32:43.799
Have a seat.

32:44.360 --> 32:44.719
Dad,

32:44.880 --> 32:45.880
we brought a small gift.

32:47.160 --> 32:48.360
You shouldn't have. Come.

32:48.479 --> 32:50.120
Mujing, sit.

32:54.239 --> 32:54.880
Mom,

32:55.600 --> 32:56.880
I knitted you a scarf.

33:04.279 --> 33:04.999
This scarf...

33:05.640 --> 33:06.999
It suits you.

33:12.840 --> 33:13.840
When I was in Yunnan,

33:13.840 --> 33:15.039
I received one, too,

33:15.039 --> 33:17.039
exactly the same as this.

33:19.239 --> 33:20.039
And a letter

33:20.920 --> 33:21.880
about cutting ties.

33:33.426 --> 33:35.137
I made this one identical on purpose.

33:36.039 --> 33:37.079
I made a mistake.

33:37.239 --> 33:38.479
I want to make it right.

33:40.719 --> 33:41.719
Eat without me.

33:55.847 --> 33:56.287
Jing.

33:57.120 --> 33:58.400
Mujing, it's fine.

33:58.400 --> 33:59.799
Come, sit.

34:05.039 --> 34:05.840
Qu Hua...

34:10.647 --> 34:11.447
Let them talk.

34:21.679 --> 34:23.280
Let's just be honest.

34:28.679 --> 34:29.840
I was selfish.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.880
I didn't want to give up my future.

34:34.880 --> 34:36.159
That was my fault.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.320
I'm the only one to blame.

34:41.479 --> 34:43.280
Today, I just want to admit it,

34:44.159 --> 34:44.840
and accept

34:45.039 --> 34:45.720
the consequences.

34:48.079 --> 34:49.119
I only ask

34:49.119 --> 34:50.559
for a chance to make it right.

34:54.999 --> 34:56.599
When you're young and writing in pencil,

34:58.079 --> 34:59.159
if you make a mistake,

35:00.440 --> 35:01.240
you can erase it.

35:02.039 --> 35:04.280
When you grow up and write in ink,

35:06.280 --> 35:07.639
even if you scratch it out,

35:07.639 --> 35:08.840
the stain remains.

35:12.079 --> 35:13.840
So are we still a family?

35:15.840 --> 35:17.039
Still mother and daughter?

35:20.199 --> 35:22.240
You were the one who cut ties.

35:22.479 --> 35:25.199
Yes, I did.

35:25.840 --> 35:28.159
But that was to get
into the math project team.

35:28.893 --> 35:30.280
You don't know how much I endured,

35:30.280 --> 35:31.599
how many cold looks,

35:31.599 --> 35:33.240
just because

35:33.240 --> 35:34.360
my surname is Fang.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.840
My very name was the reason

35:35.840 --> 35:37.280
I was looked down on.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.800
You could've changed your name.

35:38.960 --> 35:40.559
I could change my name,

35:41.760 --> 35:43.559
but can I change this face?

35:45.159 --> 35:47.159
My nose, my eyes?

35:47.440 --> 35:49.800
Can I change the blood in my veins?

35:53.760 --> 35:55.720
That all came from you.

35:59.960 --> 36:01.559
You've always taught me

36:02.079 --> 36:02.800
that I was

36:03.360 --> 36:05.159
born for mathematics,

36:05.159 --> 36:07.199
that my whole life should
be devoted to it.

36:07.199 --> 36:08.079
I devoted it.

36:08.079 --> 36:09.599
And then what?

36:29.720 --> 36:30.440
Mom,

36:31.840 --> 36:33.039
this might be

36:33.039 --> 36:34.240
the last time I call you that.

36:35.479 --> 36:37.559
If you don't want us
to be family anymore,

36:38.760 --> 36:40.280
let's make it clear today.

36:43.240 --> 36:45.320
Cut ties with me again.

36:45.440 --> 36:46.999
At least I'll know where I stand.

36:48.199 --> 36:49.039
From now on,

36:49.960 --> 36:51.559
we'll be two parallel lines.

36:53.840 --> 36:55.599
I'll never cross paths with you again.

36:58.079 --> 36:58.999
Are you done?

37:02.999 --> 37:03.800
Fang Mujing,

37:05.240 --> 37:06.440
this house is small.

37:08.240 --> 37:09.360
Where else can I hide?

37:32.159 --> 37:32.519
Dad,

37:32.519 --> 37:33.320
I'll get going.

38:16.079 --> 38:16.920
Mom, I'm coming in.

38:21.079 --> 38:22.039
They say

38:22.679 --> 38:24.079
you don't hit a smiling face.

38:24.559 --> 38:26.280
You embarrassed Qu Hua.

38:27.800 --> 38:29.240
Go see him tomorrow.

38:31.199 --> 38:32.639
Apologize for me.

38:35.679 --> 38:36.280
Alright.

38:37.760 --> 38:38.440
You're right.

38:39.599 --> 38:41.079
Everyone makes mistakes.

38:44.840 --> 38:46.440
Give her a chance to apologize.

38:49.240 --> 38:50.479
I didn't think

38:50.479 --> 38:52.199
you two were that close.

38:52.679 --> 38:53.999
We're not that close.

38:54.679 --> 38:56.079
I just like my brother-in-law.

38:58.840 --> 38:59.440
Mom,

38:59.760 --> 39:00.760
sit down.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.240
Mom,

39:11.360 --> 39:12.440
back then,

39:12.960 --> 39:14.079
my sister had no choice.

39:15.240 --> 39:16.800
And whoever does?

39:18.400 --> 39:20.119
During those years in Yunnan,

39:21.760 --> 39:23.320
you wrote to us often,

39:24.159 --> 39:24.960
and sent us money.

39:26.479 --> 39:27.920
We were afraid of dragging you down,

39:28.079 --> 39:29.280
so we didn't dare reply.

39:30.679 --> 39:31.559
But your sister?

39:33.880 --> 39:35.519
Did she ever write us a single letter?

39:39.840 --> 39:40.639
Later,

39:41.240 --> 39:43.199
I took the initiative to write to her,

39:43.440 --> 39:44.679
asking how she was,

39:44.679 --> 39:46.079
whether she'd been mistreated.

39:46.679 --> 39:47.639
She never replied.

39:48.440 --> 39:48.999
In the end,

39:50.280 --> 39:51.440
what I received

39:52.320 --> 39:53.280
was that letter.

39:55.479 --> 39:56.119
Every so often,

39:56.760 --> 39:58.159
I take it out

39:58.800 --> 40:00.199
and read it.

40:01.280 --> 40:02.920
I want to remind myself

40:04.840 --> 40:06.280
that I no longer

40:07.679 --> 40:09.320
have a daughter.

40:17.559 --> 40:19.039
Give me that letter someday.

40:19.400 --> 40:20.280
I'll burn it.

40:21.240 --> 40:22.679
Out of sight, out of mind.

40:26.479 --> 40:27.320
Yang,

40:27.720 --> 40:29.159
I'm not afraid of hurting you.

40:29.639 --> 40:30.800
I'll be honest.

40:31.599 --> 40:33.039
I always favored your sister,

40:33.039 --> 40:35.280
because I thought she was like me,

40:35.280 --> 40:37.479
that she would
achieve something in academia.

40:38.479 --> 40:40.440
All those years of favoritism

40:41.679 --> 40:43.479
led to this outcome.

40:44.360 --> 40:44.920
Mom,

40:46.039 --> 40:47.840
doesn't that prove
your teaching worked?

40:49.079 --> 40:51.400
Isn't mathematics
about absolute rationality?

40:52.004 --> 40:53.070
You just said it yourself.

40:53.559 --> 40:54.280
She's like you.

40:54.519 --> 40:55.519
Rational,

40:55.639 --> 40:56.479
and stubborn.

40:56.960 --> 40:58.039
So for her,

40:58.440 --> 40:59.559
cutting ties with us

41:00.920 --> 41:02.280
was the most rational choice.

41:03.679 --> 41:05.400
It's hard to accept emotionally,

41:06.280 --> 41:07.880
but in reality, we lost nothing.

41:09.360 --> 41:10.639
That's the optimal solution.

41:19.360 --> 41:19.960
Mom,

41:21.280 --> 41:21.960
a family

41:23.320 --> 41:24.360
can never fall apart.

41:25.280 --> 41:27.079
We've already been
separated for so long.

41:28.315 --> 41:30.182
We shouldn't keep punishing ourselves

41:32.760 --> 41:34.039
for past mistakes.

41:51.960 --> 41:52.519
Oh, Mom.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.240
The money I sent you all these years

41:57.960 --> 41:59.240
was from my sister.

42:01.639 --> 42:02.599
She must have known

42:03.840 --> 42:05.079
I would pass it on to you.

43:10.310 --> 43:11.350
Do you also think

43:11.960 --> 43:13.226
I'm an unfilial daughter?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
